//////////////////////////////// techniques ////////////////

// For KeyFrameParams:
//  1 value: updates light intensity (eg KeyFrameParams = {|1|}
//  3 values: updates light color (eg KeyFrameParams = {|0.8 0.2 0|}
//  4 values: updates light color + specular multiplier (eg KeyFrameParams = {|0.8 0.2 0 1.0|}
//  7 values: updates light color + specular multiplier + position offset (eg KeyFrameParams = {|0.8 0.2 0 1.0 10.0 5.0 0.0|}

// For random key frames:
//  Use KeyFrameRandColor / KeyFrameRandIntensity / KeyFrameRandSpecMult / KeyFrameRandPosOffset

